                                        "entry_id": "bee14c47-d9bc-366d-879c-dc7db25c227f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a graceful manner."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "59107143-b4fd-4e1f-af15-a371793de43d",
                                                "sense_id": "5a2240f1-c863-3185-a69f-351b004d6405",
                                                "text": "Suddenly I turned around and she was standin' there\nWith silver bracelets on her wrists and flowers in her hair\nShe walked up to me so gracefully and took my crown of thorns\n\"Come in,\" she said, \"I'll give you shelter from the storm\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8b4b9179-80da-4859-b6bb-a2baf33c19e8",
                                                "sense_id": "5a2240f1-c863-3185-a69f-351b004d6405",
                                                "text": "What happens then is kids are “deprived of grandmothers (maybe increasingly grandfathers, too) who are comfortable in their own skin, aging gracefully and being a good role model to kids, showing that growing old is not the worst thing that can happen to a woman.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
